      "headline": {
        "en": "State Street begins daily NAV model to support Apollo's daily pricing across $850bn credit business",
        "zh": "道富银行启动每日净资产值模式，支持Apollo在其8500亿美元信贷业务中推行每日定价"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "State Street has started implementing a daily NAV operating model for certain private markets strategies in support of Apollo's decision to roll out daily pricing across its $850bn credit business. The change moves a process traditionally built around monthly valuations to daily delivery, with both firms citing investor demand for transparency and timely reporting.",
        "zh": "道富银行已开始为部分私募市场策略实施每日净资产值运营模式，以支持Apollo在其8500亿美元信贷业务中推行每日定价的决定。此举将传统上围绕月度估值构建的流程改为每日交付，两家公司均提到投资者对透明度和及时报告的需求。"
      },
