      "headline": {
        "en": "Tree Line closes $680m private credit continuation vehicle with PGIM and LGT as co-leads",
        "zh": "Tree Line 完成6.8亿美元私募信贷接续基金，PGIM与LGT担任联合领投"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Tree Line Capital Partners closed a $680m private credit continuation vehicle, with PGIM and LGT Capital Partners acting as co-lead investors. The vehicle gives existing investors in several Tree Line direct lending funds a liquidity option while Tree Line keeps managing a portfolio mainly of senior secured, first-lien loans to more than 60 US lower middle market companies. PGIM said earlier this year it planned to deploy up to $1bn over two years into private credit secondaries.",
        "zh": "Tree Line Capital Partners 完成了一只6.8亿美元的私募信贷接续基金，PGIM 与 LGT Capital Partners 担任联合领投方。该基金为 Tree Line 多只直接贷款基金的现有投资者提供了流动性选择，同时 Tree Line 继续管理一个主要由优先担保、第一留置权贷款组成的投资组合，覆盖60多家美国中小企业，行业分布广泛。PGIM 今年早些时候曾表示，计划在两年内向私募信贷二级市场投入最多10亿美元。"
      },
