      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Bank lenders committed an estimated $121.91 billion in credit for data center properties in 2025, with an average loan amount of $1.2 billion, according to S&P Global Ratings data. CMBS issuance for data centers reached $11 billion in 2025, up 266 percent from 2024, and $4.9 billion in the first half of 2026, according to CBRE Capital Markets. Lenders are becoming more selective about sponsors and tenants as they explore exposure limits to the sector, Newmark's Chris Lozinak said.",
        "zh": "根据标普全球评级数据，2025年银行向数据中心物业提供的信贷承诺估计为1219.1亿美元，平均贷款规模为12亿美元。根据世邦魏理仕资本市场数据，2025年数据中心CMBS发行量达110亿美元，较2024年增长266%；2026年上半年发行量为49亿美元。Newmark的Chris Lozinak表示，随着贷款机构评估对该行业、特定发起人或租户的风险敞口限制，它们在交易上正变得更加挑剔。"
